/* ---- (f) #610 stepped bar clipped by ONE halfspace that both CUTS and is FLUSH:
   profile (object x,z): base [0,2]x[0,0.5], tall leg [0,0.4]x[0.5,2], low step [1.6,2]x[0.5,1],
   extruded 1 m along object -Y. IfcPlane at z=1, normal +Z, AgreementFlag .F. => the half space is
   z >= 1 (material on the normal side). DIFFERENCE cuts the leg down to z=1 (removes 0.4 m3) and is
   coincident with the step top (profile segment #620->#621, source index 2). The two z=1 regions,
   x in [0,0.4] (cut) and x in [1.6,2] (flush), are disjoint, so no kernel face can span both. ---- */
#615=IFCCARTESIANPOINT((0.,0.));
#616=IFCCARTESIANPOINT((2.,0.));
#620=IFCCARTESIANPOINT((2.,1.));
#621=IFCCARTESIANPOINT((1.6,1.));
